sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Person
    participant API as Decision endpoint
    participant Provider as Provider
    participant Mock as Mock state
    participant Core as Clew core

    Person->>API: Markera som läst (ref + displayed event ids)
    API->>API: Validate session, input and scope
    API->>Provider: access(actor, ref)
    Provider-->>API: Acknowledge permission
    API->>Provider: acknowledge(actor, ref, event ids)
    Provider->>Provider: Check case and every event owner
    Provider->>Mock: Persist actor / event read markers
    Mock-->>Provider: Stored
    Provider-->>API: Write completed
    API->>Provider: get(actor, ref) - read back

    alt Read-back confirms the events are read
        Provider-->>API: Updated unreadEvents
        API->>API: Receipt outcome = done
    else Read-back fails or is unconfirmed
        Provider-->>API: Error / unconfirmed
        API->>API: Receipt outcome = unknown
    end

    API->>Core: Transaction: handled thread + receipt + audit
    Core-->>API: Committed
    API-->>Person: Receipt (done / unknown)
    Note over API,Core: Source and core writes are separate.<br/>Unknown still marks the thread handled. Reconciliation is pending.
    Note over Person,Provider: Case status and version stay unchanged
